; per swing. Net DPS is roughly +50% over the prior fast-jab pass —
; each strike commits the player to a clear motion (matches the
; "feels amazing to use" feedback) and the damage rewards the commit.
; Previously: damage_min_range (4, 6) / damage_max_range (10, 15) /
; attack_speed_range (1.4, 1.8).
